; Many commodities in one ledger: six fiat currencies (JPY CHF USD EUR AUD TWD)
; spread across a bank, a brokerage and a credit card, plus a brokerage holding
; all 26 stock lots STOCKA..STOCKZ. Exercises the reports — and the `okane ui`
; balance/register screens — against very tall, multi-commodity amount cells.

commodity JPY
    format 1,000 JPY
commodity CHF
    format 1,000.00 CHF
commodity USD
    format 1,000.00 USD
commodity EUR
    format 1,000.00 EUR
commodity AUD
    format 1,000.00 AUD
commodity TWD
    format 1,000.00 TWD

